{"parse": {"title": "灵魂影映-03", "pageid": 119378, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%B5%E9%AD%82%E5%BD%B1%E6%98%A0-02\" title=\"灵魂影映-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">灵魂影映-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%B5%E9%AD%82%E5%BD%B1%E6%98%A0-04\" title=\"灵魂影映-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">灵魂影映</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.BB.91.E6.9A.97.E5.85.B1.E8.88.9E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"黑暗共舞\">黑暗共舞</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 黑暗共舞</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Dancing with Darkness</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_gongmu_ye\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_gongmu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>吱呀作响、不堪重负的板车将沉重的身体运送到这里。墓园的空地已经所剩无几。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638216.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-638216.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638216.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638216.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-638216.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638216.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-638216.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638216.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>爸爸睡在这里，妈妈在右边，好啦，小尼古拉，我知道你一定会选中间……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>稚嫩的手握着半粗的树枝，刨出一个浅浅的坑，大小与破旧的家里极窄的床铺无异。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只是家人的身体安睡其中，并未产生半分暖意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-638217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-638217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-638217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>睡吧、睡吧，今晚我来吹熄烛火……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伤痕累累的手细致地擦去亲人脸上的脏污，却抵挡不住漫上身体的寒冷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>呀……这么冷！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-638217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-638217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-638217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>妈妈，出太阳的时候，我们就该晒晒被子的……你说过，没有人会讨厌温暖的被窝，血食怪也不例外！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-638213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-638213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-638213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>现在……对了，我有办法！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两只手臂呈环抱状，揽过一层层落叶，夹杂几根树枝，盖在冰冷的身体上，也盖住浓重的血渍和伤口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这使他们看上去更接近安静的沉睡，孩子满意地点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638216.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-638216.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638216.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638216.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-638216.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638216.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-638216.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638216.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>嗯、嗯！不冷了吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>唔……哈啊，我也该睡了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-638217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-638217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/HeadIconSmall-638217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>爸爸、妈妈，我也要睡中间哦！和小尼古拉一样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她躺到家人身体的中间，被他们围绕着，犹如回到屋外是风雪夜，屋内母亲正低声讲血食怪故事，他们都被温暖睡意笼罩的时刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜色浓重，女孩闭上眼睛，脸上带着满足的笑意。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尼古拉：</div><div>姐姐，鸟儿在啄我们的庄稼！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>哼哼……走着瞧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩先是脚步轻巧地向前走了几步，随即猛冲跃向田地，惊起正在啄食的鸟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>不许再靠近了！小心我收拾你们！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>飞鸟恋恋不舍地掠过田地，在上空盘旋着，地上的孩子向它们挥舞着稚嫩的拳头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尼古拉：</div><div>姐姐，鸟儿是不是也饿了？像我们一样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>燃近的硝烟使生活一落千丈，因此孩子们都懂得这种感觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>小尼古拉！如果它们吃饱了，我们就会饿肚子。等我们吃饱了，或许还有它们的份儿……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>但现在不行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>嘿！不许再靠近我们的庄稼！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>争夺食物的鸟分成几拨开始分头围攻田地，地上的孩子也奔跑着，奋力驱赶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>尼古拉！用力挥你的手，别害怕……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尼古拉：</div><div>姐姐，它们啄我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>我来帮你……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>走开！走开！不许再吃了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>饥饿使动物更加凶狠。孩子的恐吓效果微乎其微，这令她感到分身乏术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>如果这里有四个我就好了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>嗯……四个我？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>对了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拿出笛子，吹响了一个音符，影子从地上升了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>小尼古拉——别害怕！我来帮你了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尼古拉：</div><div>姐姐！哈哈……你的影子这么、这么高呀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尼古拉：</div><div>有一个姐姐，再有一个爸爸，一个妈妈，还有一个我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>呼、呼……做不了这么多了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>可恶的鸟，连影子都要啄！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵奇异的、十分刺鼻的味道让她从梦中醒来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-gongmu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"gongmu\"><img alt=\"gongmu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-gongmu.png/600px-Cg-gongmu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-gongmu.png/900px-Cg-gongmu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-gongmu.png/1200px-Cg-gongmu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>唔、唔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638214.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-638214.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638214.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638214.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-638214.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638214.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-638214.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638214.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>小尼古拉，妈妈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-638215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>只是梦……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她揉着眼睛醒来，腹中饥饿难耐，转头却看见一只食腐鸟落在浅坑旁，正在啄食熟睡家人的脸庞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-638210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-638210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-638210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-638212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>不许……不许！快走开！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>滚开！滚开！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她尖叫起来，挥动着无力的手臂，试图赶走那只可怕的鸟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鸟凶恶地争夺食物，用力扑扇着翅膀，尖锐的喙狠狠啄在她的身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638214.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-638214.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638214.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638214.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-638214.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638214.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-638214.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638214.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>好痛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-638211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>不要！不要！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她摇摇晃晃地站起来，捡起石头，朝那鸟扔去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>不许伤害妈妈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>看你还敢不敢……滚开！滚开！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她终于战胜，鸟躲避着扔出去的石头，斜斜地飞走，盘旋在墓地上空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赶走了鸟，野树莓茫然地呆立在原地，这似乎提醒了她避无可避的现实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>爸爸……妈妈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>小尼古拉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>别丢下我……不要让我一个人……呜呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">收尸老人：</div><div>该让他们安息了，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老人放下板车，人死后更加沉重，将他的身体压得更弯，愈发显得佝偻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>安息……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">收尸老人：</div><div>是的，他们的身体已经开始——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>但、但是他们只是睡着了而已呀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她立刻替已经失去了语言的亲人解释，防止老人说出那个词语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">收尸老人：</div><div>唉，孩子，何必再自欺欺人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">收尸老人：</div><div>他们不会再睁开眼了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">收尸老人：</div><div>躺在这里的所有人都一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>不不不……不一样的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>野树莓的家人是不一样的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她几乎是跳起来，情急之下，一个更加荒诞的方法闯进她的心中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>我们是血食怪一家，我们不会死亡……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">收尸老人：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>我、我可以证明！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩从衣服口袋中拿出自己的笛子，手指颤抖着，吹出第一个音符。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>跟随着彷徨的曲调，她的影子开始移到家人的身体上，分别从他们冰冷的额头上升起，形成昔日的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“野树莓的母亲”：</div><div>噢，我的孩子，为何神情如此惶恐悲伤？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“野树莓的父亲”：</div><div>野树莓阁下，难道你并不知道此非永恒的沉睡，而只是一场考验？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“野树莓的母亲”：</div><div>当然，当然，血食怪的强大不是凭空而来……我的孩子，我们需要你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“野树莓的父亲”：</div><div>需要你将我们从沉眠中唤醒，结束与这黑暗的共舞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“尼古拉”：</div><div>姐姐……快点解放我们吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-638720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“尼古拉”：</div><div>别再让鸟啄痛了我们的身体……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“野树莓的母亲”：</div><div>野树莓，我的野树莓，我的孩子，妈妈最爱、最爱你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-638620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“野树莓的父亲”：</div><div>亲爱的野树莓，别忘记我们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>爸爸，妈妈，我一定会的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>小尼古拉！我一定寸步不离，让食腐鸟再也不敢靠近你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她一个个许下承诺，话音未落，那些影子已经四散，像融化一般消失了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>这就是他们从未死去的证据。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>因为我们是血食怪，我们……我们和死亡是没有关系的，永远……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>爸爸，妈妈，小尼古拉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>我一定会让你们醒过来的！一定会的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">收尸老人：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">收尸老人：</div><div>唉。孩子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">收尸老人：</div><div>如果这样想会让你感觉好一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个失去全部亲人，手无寸铁的神秘学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他不知如何劝解，只好又拉起板车，拖着沉重的步伐离开了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "灵魂影映-03"}}